rujan","event_type":"Torque Spike","severity":"Low","severity_rank":0,"npt_hours":1.6,"mud_weight_ppg":9.7,"description":"Torque increased sharply from 7.6 to 11.3 kft-lb at 1,979 m MD while drilling Girujan; ROP dropped and stick-slip observed.","mitigation":"Reduced WOB/RPM, circulated bottoms-up and performed wiper trip to condition the hole.","lesson_learned":"Expect torque increase in Girujan coal seams; pre-empt with lubricant and a stabilised BHA.","source_doc":"DDR HGJ-05 · 2010-03-27","event_date":"2010-03-27","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 1,979 m"},{"id":140,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":2797.0,"formation":"Tipam","event_type":"Mud Loss","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":13.5,"mud_weight_ppg":9.9,"description":"Seepage to partial losses (19 bbl/hr) encountered in Tipam sands at 2,797 m MD; total loss 55 bbl.","mitigation":"Pumped 42 ppb LCM pill (fine/medium) and reduced flow rate to lower ECD; losses cured after 10.5 hrs.","lesson_learned":"Loss zones in Tipam correlate across the field; anticipate them at similar depth.","source_doc":"WCR HGJ-05","event_date":"2010-05-07","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 2,797 m"},{"id":141,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":2881.0,"formation":"Tipam","event_type":"Mud Loss","severity":"Low","severity_rank":0,"npt_hours":3.4,"mud_weight_ppg":9.9,"description":"Sudden loss of returns at 2,881 m MD in Tipam; loss rate 4 bbl/hr. Standpipe pressure dropped 92 psi.","mitigation":"Staged LCM (calcium carbonate + fibre) and drilled ahead at reduced pump rate with continuous pit monitoring.","lesson_learned":"Loss zones in Tipam correlate across the field; anticipate them at similar depth.","source_doc":"WCR HGJ-05","event_date":"2010-05-12","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 2,881 m"},{"id":142,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":3153.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Cementing Issue","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":4.9,"mud_weight_ppg":10.8,"description":"Lift pressure not achieved during 9-5/8\" casing cement job; losses of 44 bbl during displacement at 3,153 m MD (Barail).","mitigation":"Re-cemented interval with two-stage job and improved centralisation.","lesson_learned":"Run CBL after every Barail cement job; remedial squeeze if bond is poor.","source_doc":"WCR HGJ-05","event_date":"2010-05-28","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 3,153 m"},{"id":143,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":3302.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Tight Hole","severity":"High","severity_rank":2,"npt_hours":23.3,"mud_weight_ppg":10.6,"description":"Drag increased to 74 klbs at 3,302 m MD across Barail clays; back-reamed to shoe.","mitigation":"Performed wiper trip to shoe and drilled ahead with increased YP mud.","lesson_learned":"Inhibitive mud is mandatory across Barail reactive clays.","source_doc":"DDR HGJ-05 · 2010-06-03","event_date":"2010-06-03","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 3,302 m"},{"id":144,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":3372.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Torque Spike","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":4.3,"mud_weight_ppg":10.7,"description":"Torque spike to 22.1 kft-lb at 3,372 m MD (Barail); string stalled twice before parameters were reduced.","mitigation":"Reduced WOB/RPM, circulated bottoms-up and performed wiper trip to condition the hole.","lesson_learned":"Monitor the torque trend, not the absolute value, when drilling Barail.","source_doc":"WCR HGJ-05","event_date":"2010-06-07","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 3,372 m"},{"id":145,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":3775.0,"formation":"Kopili","event_type":"Kick","severity":"High","severity_rank":2,"npt_hours":30.8,"mud_weight_ppg":12.6,"description":"Flow observed on connection at 3,775 m MD (Kopili); 69 bbl gain. Well shut in with SIDPP 481 psi.","mitigation":"Well shut in; recorded SIDPP 481 psi. Weighted up to 13.5 ppg using wait-and-weight method before resuming drilling.","lesson_learned":"Narrow window in Kopili: manage ECD carefully to avoid losses while holding the kick off.","source_doc":"DDR HGJ-05 · 2010-06-28","event_date":"2010-06-28","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 3,775 m"},{"id":146,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":3906.0,"formation":"Kopili","event_type":"Mud Loss","severity":"High","severity_rank":2,"npt_hours":28.5,"mud_weight_ppg":13.2,"description":"Partial losses of 38 bbl/hr observed while drilling Kopili at 3,906 m MD with 13.2 ppg mud. Pit volume decreased 61 bbl before losses were controlled.","mitigation":"Reduced mud weight by 0.2 ppg and spotted a cross-linked LCM pill across the loss zone.","lesson_learned":"Pre-treat mud with LCM before entering Kopili sands; keep pills staged on surface.","source_doc":"DDR HGJ-05 · 2010-07-05","event_date":"2010-07-05","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 3,906 m"},{"id":147,"well_id":"HGJ-05","depth_m":4064.0,"formation":"Sylhet","event_type":"Mud Loss","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":4.1,"mud_weight_ppg":11.9,"description":"Sudden loss of returns at 4,064 m MD in Sylhet; loss rate 23 bbl/hr. Standpipe pressure dropped 147 psi.","mitigation":"Reduced mud weight by 0.2 ppg and spotted a cross-linked LCM pill across the loss zone.","lesson_learned":"Pre-treat mud with LCM before entering Sylhet sands; keep pills staged on surface.","source_doc":"WCR HGJ-05","event_date":"2010-07-14","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"HGJ-05 · 4,064 m"}],"logs":[{"depth_m":25.0,"formation":"Alluvium","rop":39.3,"wob":8.9,"rpm":132.0,"torque":4.3,"spp":1294.0,"mud_weight":8.6,"ecd":8.82,"gas_units":6.0},{"depth_m":50.0,"formation":"Alluvium","rop":37.4,"wob":8.4,"rpm":126.0,"torque":4.2,"spp":1248.0,"mud_weight":8.7,"ecd":8.92,"gas_units":6.0},{"depth_m":75.0,"formation":"Alluvium","rop":39.3,"wob":8.4,"rpm":129.0,"torque":4.4,"spp":1253.0,"mud_weight":8.7,"ecd":8.92,"gas_units":6.0},{"depth_m":100.0,"formation":"Allu